390/5), tab item centered in slot: icon 24 + label 11 (skip label for center? give label too under circle? circle overlaps bar top; place label at bottom of slot). I'll place circle centered at slot center x, y = bar top - 14 (raised), label at bar y+50.\n\nHome indicator: instance of 6:42 at bottom (y 810) — it's 390x34 with dark bar rect; on dark screens override bar color? Instance child rect fill override allowed. The rect color default is probably black; on dark screens set to white. OK.\n\nStatus bar: 390x44 at top, black text default; on dark screens override time text fill + icon fills to white. Children: time text + Signal frame + Wifi ellipse + Battery frame — paint all to white via findAll.\n\nPrototype flows (after screens built):\n- 01 GET STARTED btn → 02\n- 02 back icon → 01; CONTINUE → 03\n- 03 Transactions entry (row \"See all\" / header) → 04; nav: Trans tab →04, Home→03, Profile→05\n- 04 nav same\n- 05 nav same\n- 06 GET STARTED → 07\n- 07 BTC row → 10; nav Home→07, Markets→08, Exchange→09\n- 08 BTC row → 10; nav same\n- 09 nav same\n- 10 nav same\nreactions: [{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}, actions:[{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'SMART_ANIMATE'... or 'DISSOLVE'}, preserveScrollPosition:false}]}]\nSet `screen.reactions`? Reactions set on the node (button instance). For instances, set reactions on the instance node. \n\nFlows starting points: 01 and 06: set flowStartingPoints on frames: frame.flowStartingPoints = [{name:'FinX Banking'}, ...] — wait property is on page? flowStartingPoints is a property of PageNode? Actually `page.flowStartingPoints`? No — frames have `flowStartingPoints`? It's `frame.flowStartingPoints` read-only? Writing: you set starting points via `frame.flowStartingPoints = [...]`? I recall flowStartingPoints is settable on FrameNode. Yes, FrameNode.flowStartingPoints is writable: [{name: 'Flow 1'}]. OK.\n\nScreen-by-screen layouts — I'll finalize when building each.\n\nNow write Call A: tokens