d Key\" 118x52\n\nTxnRow structure fixed width 358x64 (no autolayout, absolute):\n- chip frame 44x44 at (10,10) fill tint r22, child icon vector 24 centered at (10,10) inside chip.\n- title at (66,12) Roboto Medium 15 ink\n- sub at (66,35) Roboto Regular 12 mute\n- amount w140 at (206,12) RIGHT Roboto Medium 15 ink\n- change w140 at (206,35) RIGHT Roboto Regular 11 color\n\nIcon inside chip: default use Icon_Car_Loan flattened colored primary. On instance override: replace icon? Can't swap flattened vector. Better: icon slot = INSTANCE of media component (e.g. Icon_Car_Loan component instance) so swapComponent works. Media icon components can be instanced inside my component; per-instance swap. Icon default color = whatever media uses (probably primary blue). Keep as-is.\n\nSimilarly SettingsRow icon slot: instance of Icon_Edit_Profile, swap per row.\nShortcut: circle + media icon instance (swappable) + label → make it a component after all! Yes, with icon as instance.\nBankTab: icon as instance of Icon_Tab_Transactions default, swapComponent per tab; label text; both colored mute default.\nTradeTab: same dark.\nHeaderIconBtn: circle + media icon instance → component! 40x40, icon instance 20 centered, dot ellipse hidden default. Light version (white bg, ink icon) — media icons are colored? Need to know icon colors. Let me not recolor; media icons presumably in brand blue or dark. I'll check colors of one icon in call A and adapt. For dark theme header buttons, icon needs light color — recolor instance child fills? Instance children fills ARE overridable (like text). So I can paint the nested instance's inner vectors white. OK.\n\nRateCard: code text, price, changeChip (frame with auto layout hug: fill upTint r6, text up 11). Children named: code, price, chip, chipText.\n\nMarketRow (358x56): coin instance 36 at (12,10); ticker Poppins SemiBold 15 tradeText at (58,10); vol Roboto Regular 11 tradeSub at (58,33) e.g. \"Vol 2.8B\"; price RIGHT w110 at (236,10) Roboto Me